{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50712","headline":"奉和池州杜员外南亭惜春 · 张祜","name":"奉和池州杜员外南亭惜春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草雾辉辉柳色新，前山差掩黛眉频。\n碧溪潮涨碁侵夜，红树花深醉度春。\n几恨今年提已过，翻悲昨日事成尘。\n可知屈转江南郡，还就封州咏白苹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50712.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50712","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}